  "in_lock": {
    "$comment": "DPIDs handled IN-LOCK and never forwarded to the MCU. These are OURS — our BLE bond-management channel, not Tuya datapoints — so they are product-INDEPENDENT and belong on every profile.\n\nThey lived only on ozkie-legacy-v0 until it was deleted 2026-08-20, which would have silently removed bond revoke / invite cancel / list bonds from every real product. Verified unallocated in the manufacturer space on DS013-T3; re-verify against any new supplier's DP list before assuming the same, because 101-103 are not reserved by Tuya.",
    "101": "bond_revoke",
    "102": "invite_cancel",
    "103": "list_bonds"
  }
